# Claude Code, per machine. Not `.claude/` wholesale: `settings.json` is reviewable
# configuration and belongs to whoever checks this repository out, while the paths below
# never do. Left untracked and unignored, the first permission grant on any other checkout
# makes `git status` report a change that is not one — a standing false finding in the one
# instrument whose whole value is that a finding means something.
.claude/sessions/
.claude/settings.local.json
